' runtime remains default-off and unactivated. Existing EOD/chart/Raw/
' Curated edges remain separate from the cache-only intraday path.
' 2026-09-19: accepted calendar-source reuse and partitioned recovery evidence;
' live activation remains unverified.
' 2026-10-03: market-stream source wiring, actual-role HTTP6 evidence;
' source/local verification is not installed/live acceptance.
' 2026-10-04: current CSRF serialization evidence; local soak/fault checks
' do not establish installed or provider activation.
' 2026-10-07: realtime activation is WS-only; legacy REST helpers/routes
' remain in source, while read-only EOD REST remains independent.
' 2026-10-08: Owner service-status source wiring; local QA is not deployment.
' 2026-10-12: standalone locked calendar probe for disposable smoke QA;
' its domain path dependency and collector source inclusion are QA-only.
' 2026-10-16: R2 daily input, scheduling, reads and backup source topology.
' Wave85 candidate f215665: first-rollout recovery and six-file transition source.
' This draft describes source contracts; integrated/production acceptance is open.
' Whole-flow fixture topology is deliberately folded: synthetic-only QA, not production.
' evidence: scripts/ops/verify-owner-beta-daily-wholeflow.py:444-461,699-717
