' 2026-10-25: R4-05 source queue/API/storage and attested Linux child boundary.
' No simulation service deployment, migration apply, or runtime acceptance is implied.
' The opt-in R4-05 connection proof example is QA-only and its edges are folded:
'   proof example -> shared Harness and real in-process API router
' evidence: crates/api-server/examples/verify_approved_simulation_connection.rs:8-10; crates/api-server/examples/simulation_connection_proof/mod.rs:945,996-1005
